OL,3,GNEWSAAssistant principal banned over
OL,4,Asexual misconduct
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn assistant principal who made sexual
OL,7,Fcomments to pupils and staff in a
OL,8,F"repeated pattern" has been banned from
OL,9,Fteaching.
OL,11,FThe Teaching Regulation Agency (TRA)
OL,12,Ffound Sam Piggott guilty of 11
OL,13,Fallegations of sexual misconduct while
OL,14,Fworking at North Shore Academy in
OL,15,FStockton-On-Tees between June 2024 and
OL,16,FMarch 2025.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,392,390,260,160,0,100
