OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAAssistant principal banned over
OL,4,Asexual misconduct
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 33-year-old admitted asking a
OL,7,Fcolleague for a sex act and said to
OL,8,Fanother employee, "I cannot be trusted
OL,9,Faround drunk children" - comments which
OL,10,Fmade staff and pupils feel "disgusted"
OL,11,Fand "objectified".
OL,13,FNorthern Education Trust (NET), which
OL,14,Foversees the academy, said it "took
OL,15,Fconcerns of this nature very seriously
OL,16,Fand appropriate support was offered to
OL,17,Fthose impacted".
